# (#1361, round 3) The element-wise map's counter after a caught raise. The
# VM's `i` is the failing element (5: c[5] = inf, inf - inf); the packed map
# broke to its scalar loop at the chunk start and raised there, but it wrote
# the counter only when the loop completed, so `i` kept its entry value, 0.
# Elements before the failing one are written (o = c + 1 for them).
nb is buffer of 4
nb[0] is 1e300
nb[1] is 1e300
nb[2] is 1e300
nb[3] is 1e300
nm is reshape of [nb, 2, 2]
p is matmul of [nm, nm]
define f(c, o, n) as:
    i is 0
    try:
        loop while i < n:
            o[i] is (c[i] - c[i]) + 1
            i is i + 1
    catch e:
        print of e.message
        print of e.line
    return i
c is buffer of 8
c[5] is p[0]
o is buffer of 8
print of (f of [c, o, 8])
print of f"{o[0]} {o[3]} {o[4]} {o[5]} {o[6]} {o[7]}"
